处由低沉浑厚的男/女声缓缓念出）：\n\"水平延展的不仅是空间，更是生活的从容。光影流转处，纯粹即永恒。\""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 72, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 38, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "337a03bb19273ee084e56b16a59ad35cb07a1a04", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["https://ai.t8star.cn/register?aff=z1s872448\n\n已支持nano-banana-2，基准0.06，\n模型名字：Gemini-3.1-Flash-Image-Preview\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1590, 430], "id": 47, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "32b22c39cbe13b46df29ef1b6ab088c2eb4389d2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "aux_id": "MixLabPro/comfyui-mixlab-nodes", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "TextInput_", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c5a01a", "widgets_values": ["B站：[FG_凡工](https://space.bilibili.com/2107460586)\n\n常用模型及整合包下载：\n（常用的vae、text、clip等自行选择）\n\n**模型及工作流下载地址**\n- [FG_凡工常用model](https://pan.quark.cn/s/ad2c1d2599b3)\n\n**FG_凡工整合包地址**\n- [FG_凡工优化整合包](https://pan.quark.cn/s/7fd5d91845b9)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Model links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#b18c06", "size":